  openingText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“The middle of the house is the worst. The fog is so thick I can't fly straight, and the tree creaks at me whenever I get close. Up on the higher floor there's bookshelves that don't seem right. I don't know how these books have stars coming from them.”"
  completionText: "Phlox's Note\n\n“It wasn't stars. It was a flower, holding on to a bit of moonlight in case somebody came back. I'm sorry it had to wait so long.”"
  trackable: 1
